## 27. GENDER RULES — QUICK REFERENCE

Hindi adjectives and verbs change based on gender:

| Rule | Male (पुल्लिंग) | Female (स्त्रीलिंग) |
|------|-------|--------|
| Good | अच्छा (achchaa) | अच्छी (achchhee) |
| Big | बड़ा (baṛaa) | बड़ी (baṛee) |
| He went | वो गया (vo gayaa) | वो गयी (vo gayee) |
| I am doing | मैं कर रहा हूँ (main kar rahaa hoon) | मैं कर रही हूँ (main kar rahee hoon) |
| He will come | वो आएगा (vo aayegaa) | वो आएगी (vo aayegee) |

**Pattern:** Most masculine adjectives end in **-aa**, feminine in **-ee**.

